      "content": "TRING RURAL            NEW ROAD SP 9013                                         (East side)                                         Wilstone 10/154                                  North Barn at -                                       Wilstone Great Farm GV                                      II Barn. C16. Timber frame on red brick sill, dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roof. A tall 4-bays barn facing E. Jowled posts and mid-height rails in-line. Long curved braces to cambered tie beams. Clasped-purlin roof with 2 purlins in each slope. Long lower collar with queen-struts to upper collar. Curved wind-braces to lower purlin, long straight wind-braces to upper purlin. Flat-laid rafters. Holes for wattles on soffit of wallplates. Edge-halved scarf joint with bridled butts in wallplate. Listing NGR: SP9066113903"
    }
  ],
